```Title: Windows Firewall Profile Disabled in the Registry (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1686.003 | Severity: high | Sigma id: 9ddb483d-2b03-4f36-bca7-968dfb9c6276```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 13 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Group Policy deliberately turning off a profile; third-party firewalls replacing Windows Firewall```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13
(TargetObject="*\\FirewallPolicy\\*" TargetObject="*\\EnableFirewall" Details="DWORD (0x00000000)")
